HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ppffllooww device first appeared in OpenBSD 4.5.

BBUUGGSS
     A state created by pfsync(4) can have a creation or expiration time be‐
     fore the machine came up.  In this case, ppffllooww pretends such flows were
     created or expired when the machine came up.

     The IPFIX implementation is incomplete: The required transport protocol
     SCTP is not supported.  Transport over TCP and DTLS protected flow export
     is also not supported.

